[[SECTION]]
TITLE: FNC — Functional specs

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: FNC-ROO-198
STATUS: Active
TITLE: OnboardingChannelMapField stores optional onboardingChannelId without env fill
STATEMENT: >>>
`onboardingChannelId` is a first-class JSON field. `mergeChannelFallback` always emits it (empty string default). `discordChannel('DISCORD_ONBOARDING_CHANNEL_ID')` resolves that field. Tenant onboard empty map, `POST /api/tenants/game-setup`, and Settings save copy the field instead of dropping it. `isRagnarokSetupComplete` does not require it.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
domain: Discord bot/Channels
ssot_status: published
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: REQ-ROO-197

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: FNC-ROO-199
STATUS: Active
TITLE: OfficerDeployOnboardingHub upserts one public hub with four topic buttons
STATEMENT: >>>
Officer deploy: when the bot is ready and the circuit is closed, fetch the mapped onboarding channel and upsert one public hub message (edit-or-replace pointer so re-Send does not stack). Hub embed title `Onboarding`; body welcomes the adventurer; four buttons `Auction` `GvG` `General Chat` `Website` with customIds `onboard:auction|gvg|general|website`.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
domain: Discord bot/Channels
ssot_status: published
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: REQ-ROO-198

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: FNC-ROO-200
STATUS: Active
TITLE: OnboardingTopicEphemeral explains purpose and jumps to mapped location
STATEMENT: >>>
Member interaction: first click from the public hub is an ephemeral reply. Later clicks on that private message edit in place. Auction → Request / Live Dashboard at `aucreqChannelId`. GvG → war-announce RSVP / alias / job / party at `warAnnounceChannelId`. General Chat → GEN pings at `genroomId`. Website → VALHALLA dashboard at frontend origin. `onboard:back` restores the hub layout (still ephemeral). Mapped Discord destinations include `<#channelId>` plus a Link button `https://discord.com/channels/{guildId}/{channelId}`. Website uses a Link button to the frontend origin. Unmapped: purpose sentence plus `This channel is not mapped yet. Ask an officer to paste the ID in Settings.` No Link button.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
domain: Discord bot/Channels
ssot_status: published
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: REQ-ROO-199

