[[SECTION]]
TITLE: API — Interfaces

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: API-ROO-118
STATUS: Active
TITLE: GET /api/deploy-onboarding-card officer deploy contract
STATEMENT: >>>
`GET /api/deploy-onboarding-card`. Auth: session + current tenant + officer. Success: 200 text that the hub was posted to the onboarding channel. 400 unmapped `onboardingChannelId`. 503 bot not ready or Discord circuit open. 404 mapped id cannot be fetched. 401 unauthenticated; 403 not officer; 409 no tenant.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
domain: Discord bot/Channels
ssot_status: published
<<<
