TITLE: INT — Integration seams

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: INT-ROO-115
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Settings Send upserts the onboarding hub via Discord REST
STATEMENT: >>>
Settings Send → `GET /api/deploy-onboarding-card` → `discordChannel('DISCORD_ONBOARDING_CHANNEL_ID')` → Discord `channels.fetch` + message upsert. Pointer stored as `{ channelId, messageId }` so the second Send edits the same hub.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
domain: Discord bot/Channels
ssot_status: published
<<<
