[REQUIREMENT]
UID: INT-ROO-116
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Gateway onboard prefix opens ephemeral topic cards
STATEMENT: >>>
Discord gateway `interactionCreate` (`onboard:*`) → tenant cache via `withGuildTenant` → ephemeral `editReply` using current `discord_channels` + `FRONTEND_URL`. No Firebase write on member click.
<<<
