[[SECTION]]
TITLE: UNT — Units

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: UNT-ROO-208
STATUS: Active
TITLE: OnboardingChannelResolver reads tenant JSON and never process.env
STATEMENT: >>>
Function: `mergeChannelFallback` + `discordChannel('DISCORD_ONBOARDING_CHANNEL_ID')`. Inputs: current tenant `discord_channels` JSON (field present, empty, or missing). Output: a string channel id. Stored `onboardingChannelId` is returned; empty or missing returns empty string; `process.env.DISCORD_ONBOARDING_CHANNEL_ID` is never read. `isRagnarokSetupComplete` stays false when only `onboardingChannelId` is set; stays true when aucreq, auction, or warAnnounce is set and onboarding is empty. Not this unit: HTTP deploy, Discord fetch, payload text, Settings inputs.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
domain: Discord bot/Channels
ssot_status: published
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: FNC-ROO-198

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: UNT-ROO-209
STATUS: Active
TITLE: BuildOnboardingHubPayload emits four onboard customIds
STATEMENT: >>>
Function: `buildHubPayload()`. Inputs: none. Output: `{ embeds, components }` for a public Discord message. Embed title `Onboarding`; one action row with four buttons labeled Auction, GvG, General Chat, Website; customIds `onboard:auction`, `onboard:gvg`, `onboard:general`, `onboard:website`; no Link buttons on the hub. Not this unit: sending/editing the Discord message, pointer write, topic copy, ACK.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
