[REQUIREMENT]
UID: UNT-ROO-210
STATUS: Active
TITLE: BuildOnboardingTopicPayload explains purpose and location
STATEMENT: >>>
Function: `buildTopicPayload(topic, channels, { guildId, frontendUrl })`. Inputs: topic in auction/gvg/general/website; tenant channel map; guild snowflake; frontend origin string. Output: `{ embeds, components }` for an ephemeral message. Auction names Request / Live Dashboard at aucreqChannelId. GvG names RSVP / alias / job / party at warAnnounceChannelId. General names GEN pings at genroomId. Website names the VALHALLA dashboard; Link URL is frontendUrl. Mapped Discord topic contains `<#channelId>` and a Link button `https://discord.com/channels/{guildId}/{channelId}` plus Back `onboard:back`. Unmapped Discord topic has purpose text plus `This channel is not mapped yet. Ask an officer to paste the ID in Settings.`; no `<#`; no Link; Back still present. Empty frontendUrl on website: purpose text, no Link, Back still present. Not this unit: ACK, editReply, deploy HTTP, channel resolver, hub buttons.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
domain: Discord bot/Channels
ssot_status: published
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: FNC-ROO-200

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: UNT-ROO-211
STATUS: Active
TITLE: ClassifyOnboardingAck chooses deferReply vs deferUpdate
STATEMENT: >>>
Function: `classifyOnboardingAck(interaction)`. Inputs: customId; whether the source message is already ephemeral. Output: `{ ack: 'deferReply' | 'deferUpdate' | 'noop', view: 'hub' | 'topic' | 'none', topic?: 'auction'|'gvg'|'general'|'website' }`. Public `onboard:auction|gvg|general|website` → deferReply + that topic. Already-ephemeral same ids → deferUpdate + that topic. `onboard:back` → deferUpdate + hub. Unknown `onboard:*` → noop / none. Not this unit: Discord REST, payload bytes, officer checks, channel map.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
domain: Discord bot/Channels
ssot_status: published
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: FNC-ROO-200

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: UNT-ROO-212
STATUS: Active
TITLE: DeployOnboardingCardGate returns 400/503/404/403 or posts once
STATEMENT: >>>
Function: deploy gate used by API-ROO-118. Inputs: authenticated officer + current tenant; mapped onboardingChannelId; bot ready flag; circuit-open flag; channel-fetch result. Output: status + whether send/upsert is called. 400 and no post when unmapped; 503 and no post when bot offline or circuit open; 404 and no post on locate miss; 403 and no post when not officer; success calls send/upsert once against the tenant JSON onboarding id (not process.env). Not this unit: JSON vs text envelope on the attendance alias; hub payload bytes; pointer persistence.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
domain: Discord bot/Channels
ssot_status: published
<<<
